- ["Routing to Controller Actions in ASP.NET Core"](https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/aspnet/core/mvc/controllers/routing)
- ["Attribute Routing in ASP.NET MVC"](https://docs.microsoft.com/en-us/aspnet/mvc/overview/older-versions-1/controllers-and-routing/attribute-routing-in-aspnet-mvc-web-api)

